---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE, AUTHOR } from '../site.config';
---

<PageLayout title="Contact" eyebrow="Contact" description="Questions, corrections or ideas for a guide? We read every message.">
	<p>The best way to reach Rankfolk is by email:</p>
	<p>
		<a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="text-2xl font-bold">{SITE.email}</a>
	</p>
	<p>We usually reply within two business days.</p>

	<h2>What to write to us about</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Corrections.</strong> If something in a guide is wrong or out of date, tell us and we'll fix it.</li>
		<li><strong>Topic ideas.</strong> Stuck on something with your website, Google rankings or Google Maps? Ask, and it may become a guide.</li>
		<li><strong>Partnerships.</strong> Tool companies and agencies can reach out, but we only recommend products we believe help small businesses.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Need hands-on help?</h2>
	<p>
		Rankfolk is written by {AUTHOR.name}, who also runs <a href={AUTHOR.website} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mago Labs</a>. If you want
		your website, SEO or Google Business Profile done for you, you can contact Mago Labs directly.
	</p>
</PageLayout>
